;; spec:   stdlib §2.8 (BigInt), §4.20
;; expect: accept
;; result: 0
;; audit:  clean
;; roots:  ../../lib support
;; covers: bigint + - * quot rem mod
;; Sums, differences, products, truncated quotients, remainders and floor moduli of pairs that sit on the limb
;; boundaries of the 31-bit representation (2^31 +- 1, 2^62, 2^63, 2^93 +- 1, the i64 minimum and -1) and of signs
;; of every combination; the expected texts were computed by Python's integers, outside both fibber and Java.
(ns main (:use tl.check fib.bigint))

